# TASK-260830-8x76g1 — CR rev 12 review verdict

- Reviewer run: `RUN-260901-34271e` (claude / opus, independent of the codex producer)
- Change Request: `CR-TASK-260830-8x76g1-12`, revision 12, `repository_delta=present`
